        <item>
            <title>1.6.3</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:21:13 +0200</pubDate>
            <link>https://miq.marco-duering.net/</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/marcoduering/MIQ/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>1.6.3</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.6.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description>&lt;style&gt;
body { line-height: 1.45; margin: 10px 12px; }
h1, h2, h3 { font-size: 1em; font-weight: 600; margin: 14px 0 4px; }
h1:first-child, h2:first-child, h3:first-child, p:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
p { margin: 0 0 8px; }
ul, ol { margin: 0 0 10px; padding-left: 20px; }
li { margin: 2px 0; }
code {
  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
  font-size: 0.92em; background: rgba(128,128,128,.14);
  border-radius: 3px; padding: 1px 4px;
}
&lt;/style&gt;
&lt;p dir="auto"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fixes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir="auto"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NRRD: files that don't declare a coordinate space are no longer assumed to be RAS. Their orientation labels now show "?" instead of a guessed orientation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NRRD: 4D files that use a &lt;code class="notranslate"&gt;-time&lt;/code&gt; space (e.g. &lt;code class="notranslate"&gt;right-anterior-superior-time&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code class="notranslate"&gt;LPST&lt;/code&gt;) now get correct orientation labels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Corrected how compressed (&lt;code class="notranslate"&gt;.nii.gz&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code class="notranslate"&gt;.mif.gz&lt;/code&gt;) and plain &lt;code class="notranslate"&gt;.nii&lt;/code&gt; files are declared to macOS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir="auto"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir="auto"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnostic logs now hide file names, paths and error messages. They are hashed or redacted, so logs you send with a bug report no longer show patient or study names.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir="auto"&gt;Thanks to &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/ArioMoniri/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/ArioMoniri"&gt;@ArioMoniri&lt;/a&gt; for contributing to this release.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/marcoduering/MIQ/releases/download/v1.6.3/MIQ.app.zip" length="4608202" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="R9MjyV/T+aF/XnNEVhRxpG7sEVvTmWGmHuU6ry95kbklWTSVGi0Jf5ducrjAJ7m9EbkhE0z9JCerce2QcO62AA==" />
        </item>
