        <item>
            <title>1.6.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 14:30:25 +0200</pubDate>
            <link>https://miq.marco-duering.net/</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/marcoduering/MIQ/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>1.6.0</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.6.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description>&lt;style&gt;
body { line-height: 1.45; margin: 10px 12px; }
h1, h2, h3 { font-size: 1em; font-weight: 600; margin: 14px 0 4px; }
h1:first-child, h2:first-child, h3:first-child, p:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
p { margin: 0 0 8px; }
ul, ol { margin: 0 0 10px; padding-left: 20px; }
li { margin: 2px 0; }
code {
  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
  font-size: 0.92em; background: rgba(128,128,128,.14);
  border-radius: 3px; padding: 1px 4px;
}
&lt;/style&gt;
&lt;p dir="auto"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Redesigned settings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir="auto"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New settings user interface for improved clarity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Live examples show how each setting changes the preview, the metadata panel and the Finder icons as you change it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New two-thumb slider for the intensity window.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Each pane has its own reset button.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For 4D images, each volume now gets its own intensity window by default. You can switch back to using volume 0's window for all volumes in the Preview pane.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
